@startuml 用户注册登录

title 用户注册登录时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "Vue前端" as Vue
participant "AuthController" as Auth
participant "UserService" as Svc
participant "Redis" as Redis
database "MySQL" as DB

== 注册（买家/商家） ==
User -> Vue : 选择身份（买家/商家）\n填写用户名/密码/手机号\n商家需填写店铺名称
Vue -> Auth : POST /api/user/register
Auth -> Auth : @Valid 校验 DTO
Auth -> Svc : register(dto)
Svc -> Redis : GET captcha:{uuid}
Redis --> Svc : 验证码
Svc -> DB : SELECT username / phone 唯一性
DB --> Svc : 可注册
alt 角色 = 买家
  Svc -> DB : INSERT INTO user (role=1)
  DB --> Svc : OK
else 角色 = 商家
  Svc -> DB : INSERT INTO user (role=2)
  Svc -> DB : INSERT INTO merchant (status=0 待审核)
  DB --> Svc : OK
end
Svc -> Svc : 生成 JWT Token
Svc -> Redis : SET token:{userId} = token
Svc --> Auth : Result<TokenVO>
Auth --> Vue : { code:200, data:{token,userInfo} }
Vue -> Vue : 存储 token 到 localStorage

== 登录 ==
User -> Vue : 输入用户名/密码/验证码
Vue -> Auth : POST /api/user/login
Auth -> Svc : login(dto)
Svc -> Redis : GET captcha:{uuid}
Redis --> Svc : 验证码
Svc -> DB : SELECT * FROM user WHERE username=?
DB --> Svc : user 记录
Svc -> Svc : BCrypt 校验密码
Svc -> Svc : 生成 JWT Token
Svc -> Redis : SET token:{userId} = token
Svc --> Auth : Result<LoginVO>
Auth --> Vue : { token, userInfo }

== 后续请求 ==
User -> Vue : 访问任意页面
Vue -> Vue : 从 localStorage 取 token
Vue -> Auth : Header: Authorization Bearer xxx
Auth -> Auth : JWT 拦截器解析 userId
Auth -> Redis : GET token:{userId}
Redis --> Auth : 存在且一致 → 放行
Auth --> Vue : 正常响应

@enduml


@startuml 浏览商品加入购物车下单

title 浏览商品 → 加入购物车 → 下单时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "Vue前端" as Vue
participant "SearchController" as SC
participant "SearchService" as SS
participant "ProductController" as PC
participant "ProductService" as PS
participant "CartController" as CC
participant "CartService" as CS
participant "OrderController" as OC
participant "OrderService" as OS
participant "Redis" as Redis
database "MySQL" as DB
database "Elasticsearch" as ES

== 浏览/搜索商品 ==
User -> Vue : 浏览首页/搜索关键词
Vue -> SC : GET /api/search { keyword, categoryId, filters, sort }
SC -> SS : search(params)
SS -> ES : _search (multi_match / filter / sort)
ES --> SS : 命中商品
SS --> SC : SearchResult
SC --> Vue : { code:200, data:{ list, total } }
Vue -> Vue : 渲染商品卡片

== 商品详情 ==
User -> Vue : 点击商品
Vue -> PC : GET /api/product/{id}
PC -> PS : getById(id)
PS -> DB : SELECT product + sku 列表 WHERE id=?
DB --> PS : product + sku 列表
PS --> PC : ProductDetailVO
PC --> Vue : 商品详情(含 SKU 列表/评论)

== 加入购物车 ==
User -> Vue : 选择规格 → 点击"加入购物车"
Vue -> CC : POST /api/cart/add { productId, skuId, quantity }
CC -> CS : addToCart(userId, productId, skuId, quantity)
CS -> DB : 校验商品状态+库存
CS -> DB : INSERT INTO cart_item (ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE quantity+=?)
DB --> CS : OK
CS --> CC : OK
CC --> Vue : { code:200 }

== 下单 ==
User -> Vue : 购物车页面 → 选中商品 → 提交订单
Vue -> OC : GET /api/order/submit-token
OC -> Redis : SET order:submit-token:{token} = userId (5min)
OC --> Vue : { token: "uuid-xxx" }

Vue -> OC : POST /api/order/create { token, addressId, cartItemIds, remark?, userCouponId? }
OC -> OS : createOrder(userId, dto)
OS -> Redis : GET order:submit-token:{token} 校验绑定用户
OS -> Redis : DEL order:submit-token:{token} (防重Token消费)
OS -> OS : @Transactional

group 事务内操作
  OS -> DB : SELECT address WHERE id=? 校验地址属主
  OS -> DB : SELECT cart_item 选中项(校验上架+库存)
  OS -> DB : UPDATE product_sku SET stock=stock-? WHERE stock>=? (原子扣库存)
  OS -> OS : 计算金额 + 秒杀券抵扣(seckillService.calculate)
  OS -> DB : INSERT INTO order (order_no, address_snapshot, total_amount, status=1待支付)
  OS -> DB : INSERT INTO order_item (unit_price/subtotal 快照)
  OS -> DB : DELETE FROM cart_item WHERE id IN (...)
  OS -> DB : UPDATE user_coupon SET status=1已使用 (核销优惠券)
end

OS --> OC : CreateOrderVO
OC --> Vue : { code:200, data:{ orderId, orderNo, totalAmount } }
Vue --> User : 跳转支付页面

@enduml


@startuml 支付流程

title 支付流程（模拟支付）时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "Vue前端" as Vue
participant "PaymentController" as PC
participant "PaymentService" as PS
database "MySQL" as DB

== 卡号支付 ==
User -> Vue : 选择"卡号支付"，输入卡号/有效期/CVV
Vue -> Vue : 前端预校验(卡号格式、Luhn 校验、有效期、CVV)
Vue -> PC : POST /api/payment/card { orderId, cardNo, expireDate, cvv }

PC -> PS : payByCard(userId, dto)
PS -> DB : SELECT order WHERE id=? 校验属主 + status=1待支付
PS -> PS : Luhn 算法校验卡号
alt 卡号不合法
  PS --> PC : BusinessException(CARD_INVALID)
else 卡号合法
  PS -> DB : INSERT INTO payment (pay_method=1, card_no 脱敏后4位, status=1)
  PS -> DB : UPDATE order SET status=2, paid_at=NOW() WHERE status=1 (条件更新防重)
  PS -> DB : INSERT notification (买家: 支付成功)
  PS -> DB : INSERT notification (各商品所属商家: 新订单待发货, 按商家小计)
  PS --> PC : Result.success("支付成功")
end

PC --> Vue : { code:200, message:"支付成功" }
Vue --> User : 跳转"支付成功"页面

== 二维码支付 ==
User -> Vue : 选择"二维码支付"
Vue -> PC : POST /api/payment/qrcode { orderId }
PC -> PS : generateQRCode(orderId)
PS -> DB : SELECT order 校验属主 + status=1待支付 + 金额
PS -> PS : 生成二维码(payload=订单号+金额+二维码URL)
PS --> PC : PaymentQrVO { orderId, totalAmount, qrcodeUrl }
PC --> Vue : { code:200, data:{ orderId, totalAmount, qrcodeUrl } }

Vue --> User : 展示支付二维码
User -> Vue : 点击"确认支付"
Vue -> PC : POST /api/payment/confirm-qrcode { orderId }
PC -> PS : confirmQrcode(userId, orderId)
PS -> DB : SELECT order 校验属主 + status=1待支付
PS -> DB : INSERT INTO payment (pay_method=2, status=1)
PS -> DB : UPDATE order SET status=2, paid_at=NOW() WHERE status=1 (条件更新防重)
PS -> DB : INSERT notification (买家: 支付成功 / 商家: 新订单待发货)
PS --> PC : Result.success
PC --> Vue : 支付成功
Vue --> User : 跳转订单详情

@enduml


@startuml WebSocket即时通讯

title WebSocket 用户与商家聊天时序图（原生 WebSocket）

actor 用户 as User
actor 商家 as Merchant
participant "ChatWebSocketEndpoint\n(原生WS /chat/{userId})" as WS
participant "ChatController" as CC
participant "ChatService" as CS
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Redis" as Redis

== 建立连接 ==
User -> WS : CONNECT ws://host/chat/{userId}?token=user_jwt
WS -> WS : @OnOpen 解析 token\n校验 token.userId == 路径 userId\n且 Redis 记录一致
WS -> Redis : SET online:{userId}
WS -> WS : 推送离线未读消息
WS --> User : 连接建立 + 未读补推

Merchant -> WS : CONNECT ws://host/chat/{merchantId}?token=merchant_jwt
WS -> Redis : SET online:{merchantId}
WS --> Merchant : 连接建立

== 用户发起会话 ==
User -> CC : POST /api/chat/conversation { merchantId, productId }
Note over CC : merchantId 为商家用户 ID（商品详情的 merchantUserId）
CS -> DB : SELECT WHERE user_id=? AND merchant_id=?
alt 会话已存在
  DB --> CS : 已有会话
else 会话不存在
  CS -> DB : INSERT INTO conversation
end
CS --> CC : ConversationVO
CC --> User : { id, lastMessage, ... }

== 发送消息(对方在线) ==
User -> WS : SEND { conversationId, content, type=TEXT, productId? }
WS -> CS : sendMessage(userId, dto)
CS -> DB : 校验会话参与者
CS -> DB : INSERT INTO message (is_read=0)
CS -> DB : UPDATE conversation SET last_message, 对方未读+1
CS --> WS : MessageVO

WS -> WS : 本地 SESSIONS 判断对方在线
WS --> User : 回显消息帧 { type, messageId, senderId, senderRole, content, timestamp }
WS --> Merchant : 实时推送消息帧(对方在线)

== 标记已读 ==
Merchant -> CC : PUT /api/chat/read/{conversationId}
CS -> DB : UPDATE message SET is_read=1 WHERE conversation_id=? AND is_read=0
CS -> DB : UPDATE conversation SET merchant_unread=0

== 对方离线 → 下次上线补推 ==
User -> WS : 断开连接
WS -> Redis : DEL online:{userId}

Merchant -> WS : CONNECT ws://host/chat/{merchantId}?token=...
WS -> DB : SELECT 未读消息 WHERE sender_role=用户 AND is_read=0
DB --> WS : 未读消息列表
WS --> Merchant : 批量补推未读消息

@enduml


@startuml 退款退货流程

title 退款/退货申请与审核时序图

actor 用户 as User
actor 商家 as Merchant
actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "RefundController" as RC
participant "RefundService" as RS
database "MySQL" as DB

== 发起退款/退货 ==
User -> RC : POST /api/refund { orderItemId, type=退款/退货, reason, amount }
RC -> RS : applyRefund(userId, dto)
RS -> DB : 校验订单状态(已支付/已发货/已完成)
RS -> DB : 校验该 order_item 是否已有进行中的退款
RS -> DB : INSERT INTO refund (status=0待审核)
RS -> DB : UPDATE order SET status=6退款中
RS -> DB : INSERT notification (商品所属商家: 新的退款申请)
RS --> RC : RefundVO
RC --> User : "申请已提交"

== 商家/管理员审核 ==
Merchant -> RC : GET /api/merchant/refunds?status=待审核
RC --> Merchant : 退款申请列表

alt 审核通过
  Merchant -> RC : PUT /api/refund/{id}/review { approved=1, reviewReason? }
  RS -> DB : UPDATE refund SET status (退款→1已通过 / 退货→3待寄回)
  RS -> DB : UPDATE order SET status=7已退款 (仅退款类型；退货待寄回)
  RS -> DB : INSERT notification (买家: 审核通过)
  RC --> Merchant : "审核通过"

else 审核拒绝
  Merchant -> RC : PUT /api/refund/{id}/review { approved=0, reviewReason }
  RS -> DB : UPDATE refund SET status=2已拒绝
  RS -> DB : UPDATE order SET status=4已完成 (恢复)
  RS -> DB : INSERT notification (买家: 审核拒绝)
  RC --> Merchant : "已拒绝"
end

== 退货寄回(退货类型) ==
User -> RC : PUT /api/refund/{id}/return { returnCompany, returnLogisticsNo }
RC -> RS : submitReturn(userId, dto)
RS -> DB : UPDATE refund SET status=4待商家收货
RS -> DB : INSERT notification (商家: 买家已寄回商品)
RC --> User : 已提交退货物流

Merchant -> RC : PUT /api/refund/{id}/return-received
RC -> RS : confirmReturnReceived(userId, id)
RS -> DB : UPDATE refund SET status=5退货完成
RS -> DB : UPDATE order SET status=7已退款
RS -> DB : INSERT notification (买家: 退款已完成)
RC --> Merchant : 确认收货，退款完成

User -> RC : GET /api/refund/{id}
RC --> User : 退款状态 + 进度

@enduml


@startuml 秒杀券抢领与使用

title 秒杀券抢领与下单优惠时序图

actor 用户 as User
actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "Vue前端" as Vue
participant "SeckillController" as SC
participant "SeckillService" as SS
participant "Redis" as Redis
database "MySQL" as DB

== 管理员创建秒杀券 ==
Admin -> Vue : 填写券信息(满减/折扣/门槛/数量/时间)
Vue -> SC : POST /api/seckill/create
SC -> SS : createCoupon(dto)
SS -> DB : INSERT INTO seckill_coupon
SS --> SC : OK
SC --> Vue : { code:200, data:{ id } }

== 用户抢领秒杀券 ==
User -> Vue : 领券中心 → 点击"立即领取"
Vue -> SC : POST /api/seckill/claim/{couponId}
SC -> SS : claim(userId, couponId)
SS -> DB : 校验券存在且活动进行中
SS -> Redis : DECR seckill:remain:{couponId} (防超卖)
SS -> Redis : INCR seckill:claimed:{couponId}:{userId} (防超领)
alt Redis 正常
  SS -> DB : INSERT INTO user_coupon (status=0未使用)
  SS -> DB : UPDATE seckill_coupon SET remain_count=remain_count-1 (最终一致)
else Redis 异常(降级)
  SS -> DB : UPDATE seckill_coupon SET remain_count=remain_count-1 WHERE remain_count>0 (原子扣减)
  SS -> DB : 校验每人限领数量
  SS -> DB : INSERT INTO user_coupon
end
SS --> SC : ClaimResult
SC --> Vue : { code:200, data:{ userCouponId, ... } }

== 下单使用优惠券 ==
User -> Vue : 结算页选择优惠券
Vue -> SC : POST /api/seckill/calculate { userCouponId, totalAmount }
SC -> SS : calculate(userId, dto)
SS -> DB : 校验券状态 + 最低门槛
SS -> SS : 计算优惠金额
SS --> SC : CalculateResult
SC --> Vue : { originalAmount, discountAmount, finalAmount }

@enduml

@startuml 站内通知
title 站内通知生成与查看时序图

actor 买家 as Buyer
actor 商家 as Merchant
participant "业务服务\n(Order/Payment/Refund/Merchant)" as Biz
participant "NotificationService" as NS
database "MySQL\nnotification" as DB
participant "通知接口\n/api/notification" as API
participant "Vue前端\nNotificationView" as Vue

== 支付成功 → 买家与商家通知 ==
Buyer -> Biz : 支付订单
Biz -> Biz : 更新订单状态 = 已支付
Biz -> NS : notifyOrderPaid(order)
NS -> DB : INSERT notification(user_id=买家)
Biz -> NS : notifyOrderPaidToMerchants(order)
NS -> DB : SELECT 订单涉及的商家 + 各商家商品小计
NS -> DB : INSERT notification(user_id=各商家用户)
Note over NS : 一个订单含多个商家时按商家分别推送

== 退款/退货节点 ==
Buyer -> Biz : 申请退款/退货
Biz -> NS : notifyRefundApplied(merchantId, refundId, productName, amount)
NS -> DB : SELECT merchant.user_id
NS -> DB : INSERT notification(user_id=商家)
Merchant -> Biz : 审核退款
Biz -> NS : notifyRefundReviewed(userId=买家, approved)
NS -> DB : INSERT notification(user_id=买家)
Buyer -> Biz : 填写退货物流
Biz -> NS : notifyReturnSubmitted(merchantId)
NS -> DB : INSERT notification(user_id=商家)
Merchant -> Biz : 确认收到退货
Biz -> NS : notifyRefundCompleted(userId=买家)
NS -> DB : INSERT notification(user_id=买家)

== 查看通知 ==
Buyer -> Vue : 打开"消息通知"
Vue -> API : GET /api/notification/list
API -> DB : SELECT ... WHERE user_id=当前用户
DB --> API : 通知列表
API --> Vue : PageResult<NotificationVO>
Buyer -> Vue : 点击通知
Vue -> API : PUT /api/notification/{id}/read
API -> DB : UPDATE ... WHERE id=? AND user_id=?
Vue -> Vue : 按 relatedType + 角色跳转订单/退款页

@enduml
